.TH Intro 7 2026-11-12 DarqOS "Miscellaneous Manual"
.SH NAME
Intro \- Introduction to the DarqOS manual
.SH LIBRARY
.I darq
.SH SYNOPSIS
.BR get_version() -> Version

class \fIVersion\fP:
    version: \fIstr\fP
    edition: \fIint\fP
    build: \fIint\fP
 
.SH DESCRIPTION
In the tradition of Unix and Plan9, Darq includes manual pages for
various aspects of the system.  The manual pages provide reference
information in more detail than available from automatically-generated
API summaries, while remaining a succinct format unlike a more
discursive tutorial or contextual discussion paper.
.LP
Since its first edition, Unix has had a set of manual pages, divided
into sections.
.TP
.B 1 Commands
Commands that can be executed from a shell.



.SH RETURN VALUE
.SH ERRORS
.SH VERSIONS
This is the first version of this system call.
.SH STANDARDS
None
.SH HISTORY
Introduced in \fISecond Edition\fP.
.LP
Similar to the Unix
.BR uname( 2 )
system call.
.\"
